Zinda Me Tha Sakina Ka Nouha Mere Baba<br>
Dasta Hai Mere Dil Ku Aandhera Mere Baba<br>
<br>
1.Hai Saath Mere Shaam-e-Ghareeba Ke Aandhere<br>
Kya Janiye Kal Honga Sawera Mere Baba<br>
<br>
2.Is Sin Me Judai Ka Garabar Uthao<br>
Lao Main Kahan Se Wo Kaleja mere Baba<br>
<br>
3.Aatey Hai Agar Yaad Mujhe Apke Boose<br>
Padhta Hai Muh Pa Tamacha Mere Baba<br>
<br>
4.Dadi Ki Tarha Todh Gayi Phasliya Meri<br>
Wo Dard Hai Pal Bhar Nahin Thamta Mere Baba<br>
<br>
5.Sab Log Reha Hokey Chale Jaienge Yasrab<br>
Rehjaungi Main Qaid Me Tanha Mere Baba<br>
<br>
6.Yeh Dekhiye Khuli Mera Khaicha Hau Bundhe<br>
Mera Hai Meri Pusht Pe Naiza Mere Baba<br>
<br>
7.Kya Ab Mujhe Dekhunge Toh Paichan Sakunge<br>
Badla Hai Ghamou Se Mera Chehra Mere Baba<br>
<br>
8.Is Khakh Ke Bistar Ne Mujhe Mardiya Hai<br>
Uthti Hu Toh Yeh Jism Hai Dukhta Mere Baba<br>
<br>
9.Hai Dil Se Bilal Apka Ghamkhar Azadar<br>
Sadqe Me Usse Apke Bakhsha Mere Baba
